<title>DENMARK: FORECAST - Danish unemployment at 8.8 pct end-1996.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Danish unemployment at 8.8 pct end-1996.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Economy Ministry said on Tuesday it expected unemployment of 8.8 percent of the workforce at end-1996, with the jobless total at end-1997 at 8.0 percent, falling to 7.6 percent at end-1998.</p>
<p>Danish unemployment averaged 10.3 percent in 1995 and stood at 8.3 percent in October 1996.</p>
<p>The unemployment figures in the ministry's latest economic survey compared with a forecast for 1996 of 8.9 percent and 8.4 percent for 1997 in its last survey in October.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
